@startuml state-game
title Goose Patrol - Game State Machine (v1, A1)
[*] --> Paused : game launched\n[FR_START_PAUSED]
Paused --> Running : start / resume key
Running --> Paused : pause key\n[FR_PAUSE]
Running --> Lost : timer reaches 0\n[FR_TIMER_EXPIRE]
Running --> Won : dispersed geese >= threshold\n[FR_WIN_CONDITION, A2]
Running : timer, geese and player update
Paused : nothing updates
Won --> [*] : show EndScreen
Lost --> [*] : show EndScreen
@enduml
